    "type": "mc",
    "prompt": "Tina's family consists of her mother, her father and her brother in addition to Tina herself. Tina added the age of everyone in the family and the sum was 88. How many years does it take until the sum of their ages is 100?",
    "image": null,
    "choices": [
      {
        "key": "A",
        "text": "3 years"
      },
      {
        "key": "B",
        "text": "4 years"
      },
      {
        "key": "C",
        "text": "6 years"
      },
      {
        "key": "D",
        "text": "10 years"
      },
      {
        "key": "E",
        "text": "12 years"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "A",
    "acceptedAnswers": null,
    "answerUnit": null,
    "solutions": [
      {
        "title": "Four people age together",
        "body": "Each year all four family members get one year older, so the sum of ages grows by 4 per year. It must grow by $100 - 88 = 12$, which takes $12 : 4 = 3$ years.\n\n**Answer: (A) 3 years**"
      },
      {
        "title": "Check",
        "body": "After 3 years the sum is $88 + 4\\cdot 3 = 100$ ✓; after 4 years it would already be 104.\n\n**Answer: (A) 3 years**"
      }
    ],
