    "prompt": "Two quarter circles, whose centres are at $S$ and $Q$, fit exactly inside the square $PQRS$ of side length 2. The largest possible circle is drawn inside the region where the quarter circles overlap. What is the area of the circle?",
    "image": "qimages/kangaroo/ca-2019-g0910/q29.webp",
